   "line": 7,
   "message": "How-it-works step 2 says \"Every write, from chat, MCP or the UI, is permission-checked\u2026\". Under AGENTS.md rule 1 and R3, the UI has no write path: chat makes writes through MCP write tools. Listing \"the UI\" as a separate source of writes tells readers that screens have their own forms. The same sentence is in the 062 mock section. Change it to \"from chat or MCP\" in copy.ts and in .specclaw/mock (then resync apps/mock).",
