   "rule": "B6",
   "scenario": "A visitor reads step 2 and expects to edit records in screens. The signed-in app has no such forms.",
   "severity": "minor"
  },
  {
   "file": "packages/auth/src/gate.ts",
   "fp": "36b834026bc2",
   "in_delta": true,
   "line": 14,
   "message": "The `/` \u2192 `/welcome` rewrite only runs inside `guarded`, so without DATABASE_URL a signed-out `/` still shows the guest-preview app shell, which (app)/layout now marks noindex. robots.ts and sitemap.ts still publish `/` (\"Allow: /$\" and the sitemap <loc>), and /welcome's canonical is `/`. In that deployment every search and sharing URL points at a noindex app page. Either apply `landing()` in `proxy()` before the `!guarded` early return, or point canonical and sitemap at /welcome when there is no database.",
   "original_severity": "minor",
   "pass": "review",
   "pre_existing": false,
   "rule": "B1",
   "scenario": "Run with no DATABASE_URL and AMAX_BASE_URL=https://x \u2192 GET /sitemap.xml lists https://x/ \u2192 GET / returns the app shell with <meta name=robots content=noindex>, so the marketing page is never indexed.",
   "severity": "minor"
  }
